  "details": "Let's just say, You accidently publish your world to labs, And you unpublish it, but you can't republish it when you feel it's done, you have to wait 7 days,  I think it would be neat to request a world publish refresh, just in case you accidently publish a world and you didn't want to publish it. I think it would be a good addition to VRChat. So people who publish their world on accident can get another chance. - ~Blaixen~",
